OL,3,AEd Sheeran addresses Macklemore
OL,4,Acontroversy at Philadelphia show
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish singer Ed Sheeran opened his
OL,7,Flatest concert alone onstage and spoke
OL,8,Ffor the first time about the
OL,9,Fcontroversy that erupted over American
OL,10,Frapper Macklemore being dropped from
OL,11,Fhis tour over pro-Palestinian remarks.
OL,13,F"I never wanted to be an activist
OL,14,Fmusician but this has put me in the
OL,15,Fmiddle of an important and passionate
OL,16,Fargument about free speech and the most
OL,17,Fcomplex political issue on the planet,"
OL,18,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
