OL,3,AEd Sheeran addresses Macklemore
OL,4,Acontroversy at Philadelphia show
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaturday's show at a Philadelphia
OL,7,Fsports stadium was a stripped down
OL,8,Fevent and there were a number of empty
OL,9,Fseats in the venue when the concert
OL,10,Fbegan.
OL,12,FSheeran went on without opening acts,
OL,13,Fcausing the show's start time to be
OL,14,Fpushed back, after several musicians
OL,15,Fdropped out over the debacle.
